{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireflies</strong> is a 3D adventure healing game set in a world where light and darkness intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small spirit searching for lost lights, players journey through a forest that shifts between day and night \u2014 bringing brightness back to a lake swallowed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/9aee5cdc17e133dc1a702919d81b4573.avif?t=1761544795\" width=1560 height=426 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in this world has stopped in an endless night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that can illuminate the sky is the faint glow of the fireflies that have lost their light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, during brief moments when day breaks through, the world reveals hidden landscapes and truths that cannot be seen in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to <strong>switch between day and night</strong>, revealing new paths and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/1bdd4060d871f6690440a4c790759584.poster.avif?t=1761544795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/1bdd4060d871f6690440a4c790759584.webm?t=1761544795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/1bdd4060d871f6690440a4c790759584.mp4?t=1761544795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotionally immersive atmosphere</strong> with gentle lighting and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c5550c23a4d9d4e17b7544eae7368ef8.avif?t=1761544795\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature-based platforming</strong> that blends exploration and environmental interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/2ca6a040a6b7864dc6a5a5f70a30a9be.poster.avif?t=1761544795\" width=444 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/2ca6a040a6b7864dc6a5a5f70a30a9be.webm?t=1761544795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/2ca6a040a6b7864dc6a5a5f70a30a9be.mp4?t=1761544795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore the forest, completing objectives in each area as they follow the path guided by mysterious mushrooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>15 minutes</strong> for the main story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: <strong>3D Adventure / Exploration / Healing / Platformer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: <strong>Single-player / Keyboard supported</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack: Original acoustic and emotional background music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small light wandering through the darkness \u2014 and at the end of that journey, the story of finding one\u2019s true self.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056020?t=1761544795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056020?t=1761544795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/fd87f0b7187f15338e1010c9ffffa46bb36d065c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761544795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/fd87f0b7187f15338e1010c9ffffa46bb36d065c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761544795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireflies</strong> is a 3D adventure healing game set in a world where light and darkness intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small spirit searching for lost lights, players journey through a forest that shifts between day and night \u2014 bringing brightness back to a lake swallowed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/9aee5cdc17e133dc1a702919d81b4573.avif?t=1761544795\" width=1560 height=426 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in this world has stopped in an endless night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that can illuminate the sky is the faint glow of the fireflies that have lost their light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, during brief moments when day breaks through, the world reveals hidden landscapes and truths that cannot be seen in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to <strong>switch between day and night</strong>, revealing new paths and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay