ms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>15 minutes</strong> for the main story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: <strong>3D Adventure / Exploration / Healing / Platformer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: <strong>Single-player / Keyboard supported</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack: Original acoustic and emotional background music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small light wandering through the darkness \u2014 and at the end of that journey, the story of finding one\u2019s true self.</p>","developers":["\uac1c\ub625\uc774\ub124"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/d606d3867aeb10aaec6441371ce71f7c98cab013/header.jpg?t=1761544795","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056020/1687652051/de2079c91e73ed88e6ad9f94ebf6e94f98c6d21a/1760983684/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761538124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056020/1687652051/de2079c91e73ed88e6ad9f94ebf6e94f98c6d21a/1760983684/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761538124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056020/1687652051/de2079c91e73ed88e6ad9f94ebf6e94f98c6d21a/1760983684/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761538124","id":257220211,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220211/movie480.mp4?t=1761538124","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220211/movie_max.mp4?t=1761538124"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220211/4c85f8459494d42c422f8f3651bf35b7c